<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-09T17:42:57.418Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 17:42:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits in Zamfara have burned families alive and abducted residents, while gunmen killed a security volunteer and 11 of his relatives and seized 13 people in the same state. In Plateau, terrorists attacked two communities, killing five and injuring two, and later a fresh assault killed a soldier and three locals. In Delta, motorcyclists demanded justice after a colleague was killed at a rally, and in Ogun police rescued ten abducted passengers and killed a suspected kidnapper in a gun battle. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQWXNtNXBaUnpKUjl0MkduOEc2VEVEOGVTejJqT2plZVpLVHBfdHpzWXBoUmJhYm1tMFVrVXhyb29LaUptSmlqNEtjYjcxcWtydmhzVUo0RjltZFlGbWFMMWVWeVIteW4yVVNHMm95TnBPTlhYSlFrR3M0NHFNdXdWVExnOU5TT1U1OWRfUVJkYkF5RmpxY1dJMk9LOFlhOUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOM2FIVVJSYmFMdDFnNWE1Vm13dU5MSWdHUUFudGh1OTBBVm5paGw0dkhuYXhUeGU2TW9ObUc4eEZzLUY4akJCQjJJMTZWWmRPMkdZSllUNGwySUFTc05abjlCU0hNcEJmenE0bU9zOEc1bzJTUHZ4M3AwY0ZieWlBU2Q4aXh5UGdseDJ0U1RRQngyQXlVMFI0NGZSUzBVVUpHN0dVZzRn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPSDMwa2ZGMVphYUdKQzhfNkNtUHZSblpKNGx3WkZTS1otNDc3dmFVVGFKYU5CY3RmSlVBbURvQ0h2REtoS2pMQWpVUzVZWFFpRzBxeE1zNkE3dF9HaVdNVnBNMTZad1otYnZ3MGJLa2JXcS1RSEZwU1JXQXpFOHg3RnFBMHdGaldTUGI5SWliclR5bkM4ZzB5UmFZcHM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNX2hUUTM2dUZDTjNqWWg4bVRKcXI4VE51NDFHS1V5d1ZuSTNVLUZxRVBBMUZYWEZvRDR0YkJWQzF6eTdZQWxUVGxLRlMwUzdkZ2hrc25MU0pHdk1aNlpWa3o5Mkh2OUJrQnZvQ3dXZGpsaWRtdVBrbU5leTA1VUFucGQzSEZGTTd2ckNsNnZWcXB4QkVoa1ZYbnJPVTVYbXFDYVJ5ZF9lQ0JEdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara 